 "notes": "swift.utils.torch_utils.Serializer.from_tensor unpickles a byte prefix of a torch tensor (int64 length header + pickle stream). This helper is used to pass objects between ranks/nodes in the megatron trainer path, so a peer who can inject the tensor bytes gets pickle code execution. Reproduced at function level against the verbatim pinned v4.6.0 upstream module with the real installed torch/numpy."
